%% ============================================================================
%% SJCCC Prospectus Runtime Flow
%% Illustrates document-first bootstrapping from src/prospectus.ts,
%% zero-JS baseline readability, lightweight composition, and print triggers.
%% ============================================================================
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Parent / Auditor
    participant Browser as Browser Window
    participant HTML as prospectus.html (Static DOM)
    participant Entry as src/prospectus.ts
    participant App as ProspectusApp (prospectus.ts)
    participant Theme as ThemeManager (mode: fade)
    participant Nav as MobileNavigation
    participant PDF as PdfExporter
    participant PrintCSS as print.css (@media print)

    User->>Browser: Requests /prospectus.html
    Browser->>HTML: Parses Semantic HTML
    note over HTML: ZERO-JS BASELINE:<br/>All sections, rules, uniforms & fee tables<br/>are 100% visible and readable immediately.

    Browser->>Entry: Executes src/prospectus.ts
    Entry->>App: initProspectusPage()
    
    rect rgb(240, 245, 255)
        note over App,Theme: Lean Composition Root
        App->>Theme: new ThemeManager({ toggleId, mode: 'fade' })
        App->>Nav: new MobileNavigation(menuToggle, navMenu, mainHeader, navLink)
        App->>PDF: new PdfExporter(downloadPdfBtn)
        App->>Browser: new OfflineIndicator()
    end

    opt User Clicks "Download PDF"
        User->>PDF: Clicks floating PDF button (#downloadPdfBtn)
        PDF->>Browser: Invokes native window.print()
        Browser->>PrintCSS: Applies @media print stylesheet
        note over PrintCSS: • Forces A4 portrait page sizing<br/>• Suppresses headers, nav drawer & buttons<br/>• Neutralizes dark mode to save ink<br/>• Preserves 2-column paired cards
        Browser-->>User: Opens system print / "Save as PDF" dialog
    end

    opt User Toggles Dark Theme
        User->>Theme: Clicks Sun/Moon Toggle Button
        Theme->>HTML: Injects fade overlay & flips .dark-mode class
    end
